// TraceQL cheat sheet for this lab. Paste into Grafana Explore (Tempo data source,
// query type: TraceQL). You select SPANS with { ... }; Tempo returns the TRACES
// that contain matching spans.

// All traces that touch the checkout service
{ resource.service.name = "checkout" }

// Slow traces (any span longer than the threshold)
{ duration > 300ms }

// Failed traces (span status is error)
{ status = error }

// Server errors on checkout: combine a resource attr and a span attr
{ resource.service.name = "checkout" && span.http.status_code >= 500 }

// A specific downstream dependency by span name
{ name = "charge-card" }

// Database spans only
{ span.db.system = "postgresql" }

// Combine conditions: slow AND errored
{ duration > 300ms && status = error }
